                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be083770-125f-3ebf-8770-cb1bdc390524",
                        "entry_id": "e8247d42-73ae-3e24-8421-e87706937275",
                        "glosses": [
                            "onbenullige, onbekommerde, dartele, speelse vrolijkheid"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f430c74-f216-4326-bd56-e75a3e980e2e",
                                "sense_id": "be083770-125f-3ebf-8770-cb1bdc390524",
                                "text": "Het was bij het graf van de grote Iraanse dichter Hafez. Een groepje jonge Iraanse vrouwen gehuld in de lichaamsbedekkende 'chador' liep over het plein en trok haar aandacht. \"Ze vielen me op door hun joligheid\", zegt Akkermans. \"Ze maakten selfies. Toen ik ze vroeg naar hun kleding, zei een van hen: Trek mijn chador maar even aan, dan weet je tenminste hoe dat voelt.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3c91609-81f0-4905-9885-e4e3235263b0",
                                "sense_id": "be083770-125f-3ebf-8770-cb1bdc390524",
                                "text": "Een misplaatste grap uit joligheid leidde gisteren tot een taakstraf van 80 en 60 uur voor twee Enschedeërs. Via 112 gaven ze een bommelding door voor het wokrestaurant aan de Gronausestraat in Enschede."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f5fde24-7769-4844-9c4c-599b41df6062",
                                "sense_id": "be083770-125f-3ebf-8770-cb1bdc390524",
                                "text": "Hoewel hij een vurig pleitbezorger van Nederlandstalige volksmuziek is, gruwelt Thijssen van de vele‘goedkope’ deuntjes op radio en televisie. ‘Altijd die geforceerde joligheid en slechte teksten. Ik kan geen vrolijke nummertjes en feestmuziek maken, bij gaat het om alles wat diep in je zit en er eindelijk eens uit moet komen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0e0b19c6-300a-4ad8-b97a-6ca50d001349",
                        "source_entry_id": "e8247d42-73ae-3e24-8421-e87706937275",
                        "source_sense_id": "be083770-125f-3ebf-8770-cb1bdc390524",
                        "target_lang_word": "hilarity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hilarity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fc84add-2403-3298-ac10-f62bc1b979ba",
                                        "entry_id": "0162fdb7-ce1b-32a2-9c71-c62c1ededd0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A great amount of amusement, usually accompanied by much laughter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "334273b6-cc6e-4d4f-bc2d-cf99d32a4afa",
                                                "sense_id": "3fc84add-2403-3298-ac10-f62bc1b979ba",
                                                "text": "When the new baby's rubber duck squeaked at the wedding, hilarity ensued."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2f43db9-fbe1-4c24-a44e-ce393beee3cd",
                                                "sense_id": "3fc84add-2403-3298-ac10-f62bc1b979ba",
                                                "text": "In the rattle of the box, and of their agreeable conversation, Sir Francis’s spirits rose to their accustomed point of feeble hilarity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05e4fee1-cddf-3020-8c3f-1095b8b9fdd0",
                                        "entry_id": "0162fdb7-ce1b-32a2-9c71-c62c1ededd0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that induces much laughter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad797af8-09fb-4009-ae02-322fedd49aaa",
                                                "sense_id": "05e4fee1-cddf-3020-8c3f-1095b8b9fdd0",
                                                "text": "Think it not curious if we don't seem to be as sidesplittingly impressed with the hilarities in this picture as its promotion might lead you to expect. Hilarity is in it—hilarity at its best—as would be almost mandatory in any film with Miss Holliday."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7e6ff05-2cfd-4596-b088-36c8fcba75b6",
                                                "sense_id": "05e4fee1-cddf-3020-8c3f-1095b8b9fdd0",
                                                "text": "Many other Latin imports have become staples of our diet, like the burrito, which in Spanish means \"little donkey.\" What other food-related hilarities are we missing out on?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a79ae6cd-d88b-481f-a821-8aa4fc56a2a6",
                        "source_entry_id": "e8247d42-73ae-3e24-8421-e87706937275",
                        "source_sense_id": "be083770-125f-3ebf-8770-cb1bdc390524",
                        "target_lang_word": "merriment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "merriment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5337a63e-bd7a-343d-bbcb-fdd0f9cbc697",
                                        "entry_id": "73f9a4f2-b548-325d-9279-c4fddaef0b75",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A state of enjoyable exuberance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b2f93e4-929a-443d-9f25-198263297351",
                                                "sense_id": "5337a63e-bd7a-343d-bbcb-fdd0f9cbc697",
                                                "text": "Hugh laughed again, and with such thorough abandonment to his mad humour, that his limbs seemed dislocated, and his whole frame in danger of tumbling to pieces; but Mr Tappertit, so far from receiving this extreme merriment with any irritation, was pleased to regard it with the utmost favour, and even to join in it, so far as one of his gravity and station could, with any regard to that decency and decorum which men in high places are expected to maintain."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0297934a-1f7d-45b9-8423-b1561f2374e0",
                                                "sense_id": "5337a63e-bd7a-343d-bbcb-fdd0f9cbc697",
                                                "text": "It is recorded that this remarkable prophecy, now largely fulfilled, was received with much merriment—an undeserved fate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28754710-9ca8-3d5f-85a7-778068868d4d",
                                        "entry_id": "73f9a4f2-b548-325d-9279-c4fddaef0b75",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Playful fun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca3778be-624d-437e-9b4c-85d1a9b2b8b4",
                                                "sense_id": "28754710-9ca8-3d5f-85a7-778068868d4d",
                                                "text": "Alas poore Yorick […] VVhere be your Jibes now? Your Gambals? Your Songs? Your flaſhes of Merriment that were wont to ſet the Table on a Rore?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59bcadcc-78f1-478b-8868-bf326b521af8",
                                                "sense_id": "28754710-9ca8-3d5f-85a7-778068868d4d",
                                                "text": "For to what purpose were it to clog our stomachs with dainties, junkets, and the like stuff, unless our eyes and ears, nay whole mind, were likewise entertained with jests, merriments, and laughter?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5068610e-b610-49fa-b329-511064baeb53",
                        "source_entry_id": "e8247d42-73ae-3e24-8421-e87706937275",
                        "source_sense_id": "be083770-125f-3ebf-8770-cb1bdc390524",
                        "target_lang_word": "pleasure",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pleasure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba0ee9c0-4ecd-3cd7-9e7f-24f74e2cc8c7",
                                        "entry_id": "403e76c4-ac4c-3f6e-b4b1-f9a69de67f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A state of being pleased or contented; gratification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e64ae5bd-8491-4b02-96b0-c897c7e8deca",
                                                "sense_id": "ba0ee9c0-4ecd-3cd7-9e7f-24f74e2cc8c7",
                                                "text": "He remembered with pleasure his home and family."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d18ac841-69ed-43de-b700-543220eccc67",
                                                "sense_id": "ba0ee9c0-4ecd-3cd7-9e7f-24f74e2cc8c7",
                                                "text": "I get a lot of pleasure from watching others work hard while I relax."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a4a43b6-b5dd-4ef5-b136-c2ebd3bb84ef",
                                                "sense_id": "ba0ee9c0-4ecd-3cd7-9e7f-24f74e2cc8c7",
                                                "text": "But the only statistic that will concern West Brom will be the scoreline, and their manager Roy Hodgson will take considerable pleasure from a victory over the club he managed for just 191 days."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61d55290-fadf-49fb-9609-4d5beb58112b",
                                                "sense_id": "ba0ee9c0-4ecd-3cd7-9e7f-24f74e2cc8c7",
                                                "text": "Maximize all the pleasure / Even with all this weather / Nothing can make it better / Maximize all the pleasure"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                        "entry_id": "403e76c4-ac4c-3f6e-b4b1-f9a69de67f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person, thing or action that causes enjoyment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94268250-5fd0-4418-8bc6-037fad46b86b",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                                "text": "It was a pleasure to meet you."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afcc1f63-7e92-4079-a9f8-b196ed888511",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                                "text": "Having a good night's sleep is one of life's little pleasures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4f239c4-b995-497b-b4c8-e4226aea30a4",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                                "text": "Festus, willing to do the Jews a pleasure"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46bde89f-022e-463c-912e-9a5b2f854ff8",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                                "text": "The humor of my proposition appealed more strongly to Miss Trevor than I had looked for, and from that time forward she became her old self again;[…]. Now she had come to look upon the matter in its true proportions, and her anticipation of a possible chance of teaching him a lesson was a pleasure to behold."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "073252fc-723e-49e9-a809-d7cb2f7016e1",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                                "text": "In order to grant the rich these pleasures, the social contract is reconfigured. The welfare state is dismantled. […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "707bba07-6eb3-38ac-aa95-61e0acd0047d",
                                        "entry_id": "403e76c4-ac4c-3f6e-b4b1-f9a69de67f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexual enjoyment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b647f35-f442-37c6-8e53-a5e1b47edf12",
                                        "entry_id": "403e76c4-ac4c-3f6e-b4b1-f9a69de67f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One's preference."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73100b93-0a00-4a65-9b08-d1c74796e99f",
                                                "sense_id": "5b647f35-f442-37c6-8e53-a5e1b47edf12",
                                                "text": "What is your pleasure: coffee or tea?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                        "entry_id": "403e76c4-ac4c-3f6e-b4b1-f9a69de67f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The will or desire of someone or some agency in power."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "formal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c0fb057-8dfa-4549-bda1-3b43c4c8998c",
                                                "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                                "text": "to hold an office at pleasure: to hold it indefinitely until it is revoked"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b73d63e-6cb8-4095-b5a4-7135950a9c02",
                                                "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                                "text": "to be imprisoned at Her Majesty's pleasure: to be imprisoned indefinitely"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46e1f96a-a5f4-44d0-905e-ba7120356105",
                                                "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                                "text": "at Congress's pleasure: whenever or as long as Congress desires"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e20f195f-21c1-46b1-a8fe-ad0414c4a66b",
                                                "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                                "text": "Use your pleasure; if your love do not persuade you to come, let not my letter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9790494-fc94-4a96-9f60-fdeeb0854a1a",
                                                "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                                "text": "He will do his pleasure on Babylon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
